We used the Fire Soul to destroy the Ice Crystal. I saw the tears on the Snow Lady's face before she left.
Fragments of the Fire Soul scattered everywhere.
Since then, earthquakes have been frequent. That caused friction with the western people, the Brasolk. Everything was settled, and Gaponyeon, the Blue Horse, purified our waters.

I studied your data. The Faugn can overcome Midranda's control for moments. I need some samples.

[Challenge Objective]

Collect the Faugn Tentacle by hunting the Insane Faugn in the Sanctuary of the Abyss.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
